  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objective with the project is to deepen the knowledge and using of ICT within drama/theatre by further develop the ICT based network.The regional cooperation is defined as essential as the project aims to meet the needs to establish new ways to network, communicate and mobilise around pro-democracy theatre and is the first effort to establish partnership and joint work by using new technologies.</narrative>
